(5029889, 734650, 78638, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit distracting. IMO. I like how the red of the blurred subject draw attention to it.</td>', 'The background is a bit distracting. IMO. I like how the red of the blurred subject draw attention to it.', '2008-10-29 00:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
