(5030396, 734340, 27161, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, pretty.  I think you should give her the ice cream.  Great job.  It would be better without the TIMEX stand.</td>', 'Ooooh, pretty.  I think you should give her the ice cream.  Great job.  It would be better without the TIMEX stand.', '2008-10-29 07:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030399, 734430, 27161, '<td valign="top">I think I understand what you were trying to do here.  It is like parent spidey sense on alert right?  I think having the child almost directly in the line of your photo hurts it though.  The first thing I see when I look at the photo is a zoom in on two people.  Your idea doesn''t strike until I read the title.</td>', 'I think I understand what you were trying to do here.  It is like parent spidey sense on alert right?  I think having the child almost directly in the line of your photo hurts it though.  The first thing I see when I look at the photo is a zoom in on two people.  Your idea doesn''t strike until I read the title.', '2008-10-29 07:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030400, 734401, 27161, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this tricycle, but I don''t see an obvious motion blur.  I''m not going to say DNMC because I think there is a pretty strong psychological intent within the imagine conveying the motion of the tricycle crashing.  If that was your intent, good eye.  I''m not sure other people will see it that way though. If you had more of the trike in the picture I think you would have a stronger composition.</td>', 'I really, really like this tricycle, but I don''t see an obvious motion blur.  I''m not going to say DNMC because I think there is a pretty strong psychological intent within the imagine conveying the motion of the tricycle crashing.  If that was your intent, good eye.  I''m not sure other people will see it that way though. If you had more of the trike in the picture I think you would have a stronger composition.', '2008-10-29 07:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030401, 734615, 27161, '<td valign="top">The color of your parachutist is screaming at me.  Perhaps too saturated?</td>', 'The color of your parachutist is screaming at me.  Perhaps too saturated?', '2008-10-29 07:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030404, 734501, 27161, '<td valign="top">At first glimpse it looks like a weird robot thing rolling on the ground.<br/> <br/>I think there is too much white in the sky, causing the wind thingy to blend in with the sky.  I would try to separate them better by color or contrast.  Also, try to avoid the power lines if possible.</td>', 'At first glimpse it looks like a weird robot thing rolling on the ground. I think there is too much white in the sky, causing the wind thingy to blend in with the sky.  I would try to separate them better by color or contrast.  Also, try to avoid the power lines if possible.', '2008-10-29 07:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030405, 734287, 27161, '<td valign="top">I know it is hard to deal with, but that tree and the lights on the top right breaks the nice composition of the water and rocks.</td>', 'I know it is hard to deal with, but that tree and the lights on the top right breaks the nice composition of the water and rocks.', '2008-10-29 07:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030407, 734333, 27161, '<td valign="top">I don''t know anything about ice skating, but she looks pretty graceful.  Great job capturing the moment.</td>', 'I don''t know anything about ice skating, but she looks pretty graceful.  Great job capturing the moment.', '2008-10-29 07:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
