(5030452, 734188, 85430, '<td valign="top">it meets the challenge.  wonderful shot. nice photograph. great execution.  but i think i may have seen this photo so many times before.  i would have loved to see you tried to add a little sense of originality to the overall image composition.</td>', 'it meets the challenge.  wonderful shot. nice photograph. great execution.  but i think i may have seen this photo so many times before.  i would have loved to see you tried to add a little sense of originality to the overall image composition.', '2008-10-29 08:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030456, 732905, 85430, '<td valign="top">beautiful image. but i think there was a little overexposure.  i know it may be intentional, but i have some seen some photos like this before that doesn''t blow up all the whites.</td>', 'beautiful image. but i think there was a little overexposure.  i know it may be intentional, but i have some seen some photos like this before that doesn''t blow up all the whites.', '2008-10-29 08:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030466, 733279, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is a truly stunning and dramatic image. The motion of the dance invokes a most violent first impression and the contrast between the red and white certainly add to a battle of evil vs. good - and this shot - evil as the aggressor. The subjects are perfectly framed and the reflection in the stage floor grounds this "battle" making the participants more human than ghostly. The motions of the two subjects also gives them an almost unreal size and defines and accentuates their very womanly curves in a "Reubenesque". The deep black background places them in a wonderfully intimate setting as to say this is just between the two of us. Beautiful and brilliant.</td>', 'This is a truly stunning and dramatic image. The motion of the dance invokes a most violent first impression and the contrast between the red and white certainly add to a battle of evil vs. good - and this shot - evil as the aggressor. The subjects are perfectly framed and the reflection in the stage floor grounds this "battle" making the participants more human than ghostly. The motions of the two subjects also gives them an almost unreal size and defines and accentuates their very womanly curves in a "Reubenesque". The deep black background places them in a wonderfully intimate setting as to say this is just between the two of us. Beautiful and brilliant.', '2008-10-29 08:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030490, 734650, 51538, '<td valign="top">The view with the Municipal Building in the background is more classic, IMO.  Otherwise, the exposure is pretty good.</td>', 'The view with the Municipal Building in the background is more classic, IMO.  Otherwise, the exposure is pretty good.', '2008-10-29 09:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
