(5030847, 734534, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good subject, and the oblivious human adds interest.  Colors got washed out a bit, so I might play with bumping the saturation or contrast or some color-specific levels adjustments to bring them back.</td>', 'Good subject, and the oblivious human adds interest.  Colors got washed out a bit, so I might play with bumping the saturation or contrast or some color-specific levels adjustments to bring them back.', '2008-10-29 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030857, 734729, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not entirely clear to me who or what is moving.  I see a cat but he appears to be crouched, not pouncing.  The big thing in the back (bovine of some kind) maybe is eating?  I don''t see a head, so maybe that''s what was moving.  I think I need more definition to understand the story here.</td>', 'Not entirely clear to me who or what is moving.  I see a cat but he appears to be crouched, not pouncing.  The big thing in the back (bovine of some kind) maybe is eating?  I don''t see a head, so maybe that''s what was moving.  I think I need more definition to understand the story here.', '2008-10-29 11:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030865, 734595, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I really like the patterns made by the edges of the whirligig thingy.  The reflections don''t make quite as nice a pattern, though their birght shininess contrasts sharply with the weathered-loooking wood and weeds.</td>', 'Interesting.  I really like the patterns made by the edges of the whirligig thingy.  The reflections don''t make quite as nice a pattern, though their birght shininess contrasts sharply with the weathered-loooking wood and weeds.', '2008-10-29 11:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030869, 733349, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Just the wings in motion illustrates flight nicely, and the Macaw is nicely colorful.</td>', 'Nice!  Just the wings in motion illustrates flight nicely, and the Macaw is nicely colorful.', '2008-10-29 11:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030874, 734276, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene and the water came out beautifully.  Colors are more washed out than I expect in a fall scene; I''d bump the saturation and/or contrast and do a white balance adjustment (this looks a little too yellow on my monitor).</td>', 'Lovely scene and the water came out beautifully.  Colors are more washed out than I expect in a fall scene; I''d bump the saturation and/or contrast and do a white balance adjustment (this looks a little too yellow on my monitor).', '2008-10-29 11:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030878, 734186, 65234, '<td valign="top">The reflections of the hand in the ball (bubble?) are very cool.  I also like the contrast between the gritty bricks and the delicacy of the reflective thing, the solidity of reality vs. the fragility of a dream.</td>', 'The reflections of the hand in the ball (bubble?) are very cool.  I also like the contrast between the gritty bricks and the delicacy of the reflective thing, the solidity of reality vs. the fragility of a dream.', '2008-10-29 11:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030883, 733948, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow, almost everything is in motion here!  Bright colors suit the subject well.</td>', 'Wow, almost everything is in motion here!  Bright colors suit the subject well.', '2008-10-29 11:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030886, 734340, 65234, '<td valign="top">She does not look thrilled to be standing there while everyone has to detour around her ;-)  well done overall, though I would prefer not to have the in-focus Timex box in the shot to distract me from the girl.</td>', 'She does not look thrilled to be standing there while everyone has to detour around her ;-)  well done overall, though I would prefer not to have the in-focus Timex box in the shot to distract me from the girl.', '2008-10-29 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030888, 734223, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very, very fast.  Just enough of his face in focus to see his determined look.</td>', 'Very, very fast.  Just enough of his face in focus to see his determined look.', '2008-10-29 11:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030892, 734115, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  That looks like a tricky exposure to get some definition in the blur and not blow out all the other lights.</td>', 'Nice shot!  That looks like a tricky exposure to get some definition in the blur and not blow out all the other lights.', '2008-10-29 11:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030893, 733266, 65234, '<td valign="top">With the 45 adapter in the middle and everything.  I''m officially old ;-)</td>', 'With the 45 adapter in the middle and everything.  I''m officially old ;-)', '2008-10-29 11:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
