(5031086, 733279, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  So artistically done.  It is definitely in my top 2 favorites.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  So artistically done.  It is definitely in my top 2 favorites.', '2008-10-29 12:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031088, 734446, 24454, '<td valign="top">Blur at its most beautiful!</td>', 'Blur at its most beautiful!', '2008-10-29 12:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031186, 734592, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is motion blur, camera shake, or just some sort of induced effect. Kind of neat looking, but needs some more kick to score highly.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is motion blur, camera shake, or just some sort of induced effect. Kind of neat looking, but needs some more kick to score highly.', '2008-10-29 13:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031191, 734033, 83313, '<td valign="top">A pleasant scene and decently done, but it does not seem to have any of the punch to it that I have seen in many similar landscape shots. Maybe needs some more levels/curves tweaks?</td>', 'A pleasant scene and decently done, but it does not seem to have any of the punch to it that I have seen in many similar landscape shots. Maybe needs some more levels/curves tweaks?', '2008-10-29 13:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031192, 734444, 83313, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling. Just wait for 17.</td>', 'I know the feeling. Just wait for 17.', '2008-10-29 13:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031205, 734693, 83313, '<td valign="top">I would think this was an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=94403" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">lpatrick</a> entry, except that I think he is in the Money challenge instead. Definitely his abstract style, however. It''s curiously engaging. I find that as I look at it, there are very subtle details and textures that I begin to see in the pattern. Pure abstracts tend to not do well in voting, I''ll be curious to see how this one does.</td>', 'I would think this was an  lpatrick entry, except that I think he is in the Money challenge instead. Definitely his abstract style, however. It''s curiously engaging. I find that as I look at it, there are very subtle details and textures that I begin to see in the pattern. Pure abstracts tend to not do well in voting, I''ll be curious to see how this one does.', '2008-10-29 13:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031231, 734679, 98141, '<td valign="top">This makes me exceedingly dizzy - Well done :)</td>', 'This makes me exceedingly dizzy - Well done :)', '2008-10-29 13:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031234, 734161, 98141, '<td valign="top">It seems like this is almost not blurry enough - It took me a minute to find the red light streaks of motion.</td>', 'It seems like this is almost not blurry enough - It took me a minute to find the red light streaks of motion.', '2008-10-29 13:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031248, 734713, 98141, '<td valign="top">I really like this, you captured just the right amount of blur to still tell what the subject is but to warp it at the same time. I''d be curious to see a how-to on this style of photography someday, I think you hit the nail on the head.</td>', 'I really like this, you captured just the right amount of blur to still tell what the subject is but to warp it at the same time. I''d be curious to see a how-to on this style of photography someday, I think you hit the nail on the head.', '2008-10-29 14:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031257, 734577, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the stars above, too. Great shot.</td>', 'I love the stars above, too. Great shot.', '2008-10-29 14:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031343, 734376, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the play of light on the guitar. You need to watch your JPEG compression ratio, however. I can see some compression artifacts in this, most clearly around the volume and tone dials, also quite a bit in the lighter reflection under the strings. Your file size is only 75k and you could have used up to 150k, which would have eliminated visible artifacting.</td>', 'I like the colors and the play of light on the guitar. You need to watch your JPEG compression ratio, however. I can see some compression artifacts in this, most clearly around the volume and tone dials, also quite a bit in the lighter reflection under the strings. Your file size is only 75k and you could have used up to 150k, which would have eliminated visible artifacting.', '2008-10-29 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031404, 734565, 83544, '<td valign="top">it seems that the blur in this photo plays a little role and that''s no good</td>', 'it seems that the blur in this photo plays a little role and that''s no good', '2008-10-29 15:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031408, 733279, 83544, '<td valign="top">somehow this photo reminds me of that russian movie NIghtwatch, great photo btw</td>', 'somehow this photo reminds me of that russian movie NIghtwatch, great photo btw', '2008-10-29 15:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
