(5031738, 734549, 92577, '<td valign="top">Has an over-processed feel to it but I still like it and think it will score well</td>', 'Has an over-processed feel to it but I still like it and think it will score well', '2008-10-29 18:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031739, 734203, 92577, '<td valign="top">terrific</td>', 'terrific', '2008-10-29 18:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031814, 734203, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous and after viewing all the entries I am raising your score.  The B&amp;W is perfect, the motion accentuates the perfect still that would, in itself, be an excellent photo.</td>', 'This is gorgeous and after viewing all the entries I am raising your score.  The B&W is perfect, the motion accentuates the perfect still that would, in itself, be an excellent photo.', '2008-10-29 19:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031817, 733374, 83845, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge and a high scorer.  Great colors, great focus AND motion blur.  Raising my previous vote this second time around.  8</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge and a high scorer.  Great colors, great focus AND motion blur.  Raising my previous vote this second time around.  8', '2008-10-29 19:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031821, 734549, 83845, '<td valign="top">Composition and especially the fall colors are simple awesome.  Fits the challenge very well.  This second time around I''m adjusting scores and raising yours to a much deserved 8.</td>', 'Composition and especially the fall colors are simple awesome.  Fits the challenge very well.  This second time around I''m adjusting scores and raising yours to a much deserved 8.', '2008-10-29 19:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031825, 733320, 83845, '<td valign="top">This photo struck me the first time around and equally as much this second time.  Bumping you up...  I love the colors, the expression, and the action!</td>', 'This photo struck me the first time around and equally as much this second time.  Bumping you up...  I love the colors, the expression, and the action!', '2008-10-29 19:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031826, 733279, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  Really stands out among the competition and one of my faves!  Colors and especially the MOTION are outstanding!  Bumping you up to a more deserved 9!</td>', 'This is awesome!  Really stands out among the competition and one of my faves!  Colors and especially the MOTION are outstanding!  Bumping you up to a more deserved 9!', '2008-10-29 19:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031833, 734199, 83845, '<td valign="top">A very dreamy picture!  Impeccable clarity!</td>', 'A very dreamy picture!  Impeccable clarity!', '2008-10-29 19:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031835, 734477, 83845, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  Top 10 at least, in my opinion.  Fits the challenge excellently!</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  Top 10 at least, in my opinion.  Fits the challenge excellently!', '2008-10-29 19:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031837, 734399, 83845, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed!</td>', 'Great idea and well executed!', '2008-10-29 19:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031838, 733513, 83845, '<td valign="top">Very well executed!  Perfect for the challenge!  In viewing a second time around I''m bumping to a well deserved 7.</td>', 'Very well executed!  Perfect for the challenge!  In viewing a second time around I''m bumping to a well deserved 7.', '2008-10-29 19:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031841, 733349, 83845, '<td valign="top">Exposure just right to keep the bird focused and wings in motion.  Perfect for the challenge.  Hard to comment critically on such a high scoring photo, but maybe the reds in the background distract a little.  :)  Bumping my previous vote to a 7.</td>', 'Exposure just right to keep the bird focused and wings in motion.  Perfect for the challenge.  Hard to comment critically on such a high scoring photo, but maybe the reds in the background distract a little.  :)  Bumping my previous vote to a 7.', '2008-10-29 19:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031843, 734703, 83845, '<td valign="top">Great panning on a fast action!</td>', 'Great panning on a fast action!', '2008-10-29 19:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031844, 734513, 83845, '<td valign="top">A photo deserving of a bump the second time around.  Action packed, fits the challenge, and great PP.  7</td>', 'A photo deserving of a bump the second time around.  Action packed, fits the challenge, and great PP.  7', '2008-10-29 19:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031845, 734231, 83845, '<td valign="top">After viewing the entire challenge, this is a great OOB photo!  Good PP, but maybe a square crop... or maybe a more centralized angle directly under, or both.  One of my top 20 easy!</td>', 'After viewing the entire challenge, this is a great OOB photo!  Good PP, but maybe a square crop... or maybe a more centralized angle directly under, or both.  One of my top 20 easy!', '2008-10-29 19:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031847, 734446, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is one of the more mesmerizing water movement photos.  Great exposure!  Great colors!  Deserving of a bump this second time around.  7</td>', 'This is one of the more mesmerizing water movement photos.  Great exposure!  Great colors!  Deserving of a bump this second time around.  7', '2008-10-29 19:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031852, 734340, 83845, '<td valign="top">I see what you were trying to do here... and you did it very well.  I wish there were more of a story, like the little girl looking worried or lost instead of just trying to stay still.  If only she could have been as still as the timex thing in the top left.  It would have been more of an impact.  Still high scoring in this challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'I see what you were trying to do here... and you did it very well.  I wish there were more of a story, like the little girl looking worried or lost instead of just trying to stay still.  If only she could have been as still as the timex thing in the top left.  It would have been more of an impact.  Still high scoring in this challenge in my opinion.', '2008-10-29 20:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
