(5032633, 733538, 83008, '<td valign="top">Nice panning.. Not easy to get it right, so well done. Could possibly have left more room on the left, so that the car has more room to "drive into".</td>', 'Nice panning.. Not easy to get it right, so well done. Could possibly have left more room on the left, so that the car has more room to "drive into".', '2008-10-30 09:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
