(5033695, 733279, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion, and the pastel colors are beautiful<br/>(not voting)</td>', 'Great sense of motion, and the pastel colors are beautiful(not voting)', '2008-10-30 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033701, 733619, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like this painting and the brush strokes made of the moving flakes. Great minimalistic work.<br/> <br/>(not voting)</td>', 'I like this painting and the brush strokes made of the moving flakes. Great minimalistic work. (not voting)', '2008-10-30 22:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033704, 734430, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like this image. The boy is in focus and as the central figure he is correctly placed for this effect. If this were a ''zoom blur'' challenge, I would give this a high vote. However, since it is a ''motion blur'' challenge, I will give it a lower vote.</td>', 'I like this image. The boy is in focus and as the central figure he is correctly placed for this effect. If this were a ''zoom blur'' challenge, I would give this a high vote. However, since it is a ''motion blur'' challenge, I will give it a lower vote.', '2008-10-30 22:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033705, 733948, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great job in painting the background!<br/>(not voting)</td>', 'Great job in painting the background!(not voting)', '2008-10-30 22:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033708, 734295, 51747, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really good here. I also like your idea, since a drummer is full of motion in a confined space. For this to be a better shot, the stationary objects (drums,cymbal stands) Should be crisp and in focus. The drummer and the objects that move should be blurred due to motion. Hope this helps!</td>', 'The lighting is really good here. I also like your idea, since a drummer is full of motion in a confined space. For this to be a better shot, the stationary objects (drums,cymbal stands) Should be crisp and in focus. The drummer and the objects that move should be blurred due to motion. Hope this helps!', '2008-10-30 22:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033712, 733513, 51747, '<td valign="top">This image looks great! Captures motion blur very well. I detect some zoom blur there as well. Only nitpik is that it''s a bit hot.</td>', 'This image looks great! Captures motion blur very well. I detect some zoom blur there as well. Only nitpik is that it''s a bit hot.', '2008-10-30 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033713, 734444, 97166, '<td valign="top">Had you managed to get the mother more solid, it would have cemented this image.  Another idea is to have the last image of the boy in perfect focus too. (Not for the challenge of course, but using all kinds of cloning layers).<br/> <br/>There''s some great outside-of-DPC potential in this photo.</td>', 'Had you managed to get the mother more solid, it would have cemented this image.  Another idea is to have the last image of the boy in perfect focus too. (Not for the challenge of course, but using all kinds of cloning layers). There''s some great outside-of-DPC potential in this photo.', '2008-10-30 22:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033716, 734477, 97166, '<td valign="top">Without a doubt, one of the best photographs I''ve seen on DPC since joining.<br/> <br/>Would that I could give it a 20.</td>', 'Without a doubt, one of the best photographs I''ve seen on DPC since joining. Would that I could give it a 20.', '2008-10-30 22:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033725, 733531, 51747, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Great lighting and exposure. Well captured. Could use a bit more dirt or foreground to show the motion off better.</td>', 'Cool shot. Great lighting and exposure. Well captured. Could use a bit more dirt or foreground to show the motion off better.', '2008-10-30 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
