(5037417, 733498, 35708, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful but I just don''t think there is enough in the composition to really see what it is... it''s really just some fancy colors.</td>', 'The colors are beautiful but I just don''t think there is enough in the composition to really see what it is... it''s really just some fancy colors.', '2008-11-01 22:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
