(5037419, 734544, 35708, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos where it is missing that one little touch that actually makes it stand out. In this form it just looks like a photo shot out of focus.</td>', 'This is one of those photos where it is missing that one little touch that actually makes it stand out. In this form it just looks like a photo shot out of focus.', '2008-11-01 22:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037421, 733100, 35708, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective on this one. I really like what you did with it but it just doesn''t jump out at me. I wish I could say what would make it pop but I just don''t know. But I love the idea and the perspective you gave to this one so it is definitely an above average shot.</td>', 'Very interesting perspective on this one. I really like what you did with it but it just doesn''t jump out at me. I wish I could say what would make it pop but I just don''t know. But I love the idea and the perspective you gave to this one so it is definitely an above average shot.', '2008-11-01 22:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037422, 733236, 35708, '<td valign="top">There just isn''t enough to this to make it tell the story you were going for. Its just a blurry photo.</td>', 'There just isn''t enough to this to make it tell the story you were going for. Its just a blurry photo.', '2008-11-01 22:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037423, 733349, 35708, '<td valign="top">Its a nice shot but just lacks something to make it really stand out.</td>', 'Its a nice shot but just lacks something to make it really stand out.', '2008-11-01 22:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037424, 734186, 35708, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great execution, and just an overall great photo. Nice one.</td>', 'Great idea, great execution, and just an overall great photo. Nice one.', '2008-11-01 22:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037425, 734506, 35708, '<td valign="top">The lights hanging down are a little over blown but the tea cups are just freaking awesome. Very very nice!</td>', 'The lights hanging down are a little over blown but the tea cups are just freaking awesome. Very very nice!', '2008-11-01 22:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037426, 734577, 35708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery but lacks the "pop" to get it marked really high. Still above average shot though.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery but lacks the "pop" to get it marked really high. Still above average shot though.', '2008-11-01 22:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
