(5037773, 734203, 98260, '<td valign="top">Great concept!</td>', 'Great concept!', '2008-11-02 01:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037864, 734161, 21084, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot, The red line accross the middle of the photo is a bit distracting - I know it can not be helped in long exposure shots, but maybe you had one without it in? for me that dropps the pic from a 8 to a 7.<br/>Well done none the less, it is the type of photo, the Diner should buy from you - or at least free ice creams for the rest of the year?<br/> <br/>Nice framing, sharpness - well done</td>', 'I like this photo a lot, The red line accross the middle of the photo is a bit distracting - I know it can not be helped in long exposure shots, but maybe you had one without it in? for me that dropps the pic from a 8 to a 7.Well done none the less, it is the type of photo, the Diner should buy from you - or at least free ice creams for the rest of the year? Nice framing, sharpness - well done', '2008-11-02 02:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038012, 734161, 76598, '<td valign="top">The blur, which I assume are cars going by, isn''t very obvious.  Colors, focus, etc are right on.</td>', 'The blur, which I assume are cars going by, isn''t very obvious.  Colors, focus, etc are right on.', '2008-11-02 06:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038820, 733946, 11467, '<td valign="top">I would have givn this more points, but the crooked horizon got to me. Still a nice photo. Good composition. Foreground interest to draw you in.</td>', 'I would have givn this more points, but the crooked horizon got to me. Still a nice photo. Good composition. Foreground interest to draw you in.', '2008-11-02 13:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038821, 734253, 58457, '<td valign="top">This is a nice concept for the challenge. It really emphasizes the mundane task of waiting.  My only wish is that the building is a bit crooked in the background... I''m sure if that were straight though, the line of people would be crooked so I don''t really know the best solution.</td>', 'This is a nice concept for the challenge. It really emphasizes the mundane task of waiting.  My only wish is that the building is a bit crooked in the background... I''m sure if that were straight though, the line of people would be crooked so I don''t really know the best solution.', '2008-11-02 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038822, 733932, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great emotion in this. 7</td>', 'Great emotion in this. 7', '2008-11-02 13:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038824, 734285, 58457, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo, but you lose a lot on its small size.</td>', 'This is a cool photo, but you lose a lot on its small size.', '2008-11-02 13:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038828, 734285, 11467, '<td valign="top">Very cool Image is a bit small. Try to make sure it is 640 pixels wide.</td>', 'Very cool Image is a bit small. Try to make sure it is 640 pixels wide.', '2008-11-02 13:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038829, 733049, 58457, '<td valign="top">I''m curious how fast the car was actually going.  Its impressive how sharp the car is as well as the lines in the road.</td>', 'I''m curious how fast the car was actually going.  Its impressive how sharp the car is as well as the lines in the road.', '2008-11-02 13:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038833, 733948, 11467, '<td valign="top">I like how the face and body are sharp, and the rest of the image is blurred. Shame the left hand is cropped off, but apart from that it has good composition.</td>', 'I like how the face and body are sharp, and the rest of the image is blurred. Shame the left hand is cropped off, but apart from that it has good composition.', '2008-11-02 13:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038844, 734703, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Interesting perspective. A shame the rider isn''t a little sharper. Perhaps the use of a flash would help to freeze the movement. From the composition I would say by cropping a little of the image from behind the rider it would help get him out of the centre of the image.<br/>I love the autumn colours.</td>', 'Nice photo. Interesting perspective. A shame the rider isn''t a little sharper. Perhaps the use of a flash would help to freeze the movement. From the composition I would say by cropping a little of the image from behind the rider it would help get him out of the centre of the image.I love the autumn colours.', '2008-11-02 13:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038847, 733531, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Bright colours and nice and sharp. Good composition. Unfortunately the lack of details in the foreground make it difficult to see that it is blurred. It is only on my second time through that I noticed this. Unfortunately this will probably result in lower marks that it deserves.</td>', 'Great photo. Bright colours and nice and sharp. Good composition. Unfortunately the lack of details in the foreground make it difficult to see that it is blurred. It is only on my second time through that I noticed this. Unfortunately this will probably result in lower marks that it deserves.', '2008-11-02 13:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038851, 733364, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think this would be much better with a better setup/background...  Its a cool shot with a somewhat boring setting.</td>', 'I think this would be much better with a better setup/background...  Its a cool shot with a somewhat boring setting.', '2008-11-02 13:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038855, 733341, 11467, '<td valign="top">Although the image is showing some motion blur it seems to be missing some punch. An other camera position to hide the wall corner would help. Also a little work on contrast and brightness would help this.</td>', 'Although the image is showing some motion blur it seems to be missing some punch. An other camera position to hide the wall corner would help. Also a little work on contrast and brightness would help this.', '2008-11-02 13:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038858, 734291, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Nice detail on the hands and interesting colours. Good blur on the wheel and clay.</td>', 'Nice image. Nice detail on the hands and interesting colours. Good blur on the wheel and clay.', '2008-11-02 13:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038860, 734675, 11467, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you did this but I really like it.<br/>Nice colours. I ike how the pedestrian is right on that circle.</td>', 'I don''t know how you did this but I really like it.Nice colours. I ike how the pedestrian is right on that circle.', '2008-11-02 13:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038870, 733296, 58457, '<td valign="top">needs quite a bit of processing work....  also,. your title is "dreams" but the first thing I noticed is that the person on the left is about to wipe out.</td>', 'needs quite a bit of processing work....  also,. your title is "dreams" but the first thing I noticed is that the person on the left is about to wipe out.', '2008-11-02 13:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038872, 734748, 11467, '<td valign="top">Very well done zoom blur. I like how the pink of the jacket makes a nice glow.</td>', 'Very well done zoom blur. I like how the pink of the jacket makes a nice glow.', '2008-11-02 13:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038883, 734200, 11467, '<td valign="top">This is missing a little pop. I think a bit of a play with level and curves could make this a more interesting picture.</td>', 'This is missing a little pop. I think a bit of a play with level and curves could make this a more interesting picture.', '2008-11-02 13:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038887, 733296, 11467, '<td valign="top">This is half camera shake and half motion blur. Image needs to be a bit brighter too. Try using a tripod or resting the camera on the rail or a stable surface to stabilize it more</td>', 'This is half camera shake and half motion blur. Image needs to be a bit brighter too. Try using a tripod or resting the camera on the rail or a stable surface to stabilize it more', '2008-11-02 13:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038899, 734607, 58457, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on this one...</td>', 'Interesting perspective on this one...', '2008-11-02 13:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038906, 734327, 11467, '<td valign="top">I would have rotated this a little to the left and boosted the contrast and brightness a little. I like the composition though.<br/>Next time make the picture bigger too.</td>', 'I would have rotated this a little to the left and boosted the contrast and brightness a little. I like the composition though.Next time make the picture bigger too.', '2008-11-02 13:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038912, 733320, 11467, '<td valign="top">Even though this is very blurred, I think it shows the excitement and action well.</td>', 'Even though this is very blurred, I think it shows the excitement and action well.', '2008-11-02 13:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
