(5044895, 733349, 14437, '<td valign="top">Wow, never thought that this would end up in Top 20. This is my personal second best, in both rating and rank. Thank you so much for the votes.<br/> <br/>This was captured during a daily bird show in Kuala Lumpur Bird Park, Malaysia.</td>', 'Wow, never thought that this would end up in Top 20. This is my personal second best, in both rating and rank. Thank you so much for the votes. This was captured during a daily bird show in Kuala Lumpur Bird Park, Malaysia.', '2008-11-05 00:40:36.000000', NULL, 0),
