(5044916, 734444, 14986, '<td valign="top">The original idea was to have the mom hold her baby standing still and sharp, with the two year old circling around her to make the blur. <br/> <br/>Well, baby was napping at first, so we didn''t want to wake him.  2 yr. old needed constant motivation from mom to walk around her doing things, so she was blurry.  This was the best shot of the series, but not really what I had in mind.  I actually did kind of like the colors of her room and thought they photographed well.  There was a crispness to the background that offset the blurring nicely.</td>', 'The original idea was to have the mom hold her baby standing still and sharp, with the two year old circling around her to make the blur.  Well, baby was napping at first, so we didn''t want to wake him.  2 yr. old needed constant motivation from mom to walk around her doing things, so she was blurry.  This was the best shot of the series, but not really what I had in mind.  I actually did kind of like the colors of her room and thought they photographed well.  There was a crispness to the background that offset the blurring nicely.', '2008-11-05 00:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
