(5045859, 734569, 56002, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely.  I took the liberty of adding a Multiply layer (which I was planning to apply with a gradient mask) - and I loved the result (I left it applied to the whole image).  Just tossing ideas around... see what you think.<br/> <br/>Edit to add:  du... This was a basic-edit challenge entry. I just didn''t register that fact right away. Sorry. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-05 13:20:01.</i></td>', 'This is really lovely.  I took the liberty of adding a Multiply layer (which I was planning to apply with a gradient mask) - and I loved the result (I left it applied to the whole image).  Just tossing ideas around... see what you think. Edit to add:  du... This was a basic-edit challenge entry. I just didn''t register that fact right away. Sorry. ', '2008-11-05 08:25:41.000000', '2008-11-05 13:20:01.000000', 0),
