(5045971, 733664, 70514, '<td valign="top">You have this technique down to a science.  I (as always) love the way you converted this to b/w, the composition is wonderful, and the motion really adds such a timeless and (to me at least) a sad feel.  Lovely.</td>', 'You have this technique down to a science.  I (as always) love the way you converted this to b/w, the composition is wonderful, and the motion really adds such a timeless and (to me at least) a sad feel.  Lovely.', '2008-11-05 09:33:06.000000', NULL, 0),
