(5045982, 734418, 96721, '<td valign="top">Haha sorry but that''s almost funny, one commentor wanting it sharper and the other saying there is no motion blur, jeez you can''t win...<br/> <br/>Seriously people you need to stop, check the description of the challenge, look at each damn image for more than 2 seconds and then think before voting.<br/> <br/>Great image and definitely underrated, love the tilt and the positioning of the subject.</td>', 'Haha sorry but that''s almost funny, one commentor wanting it sharper and the other saying there is no motion blur, jeez you can''t win... Seriously people you need to stop, check the description of the challenge, look at each damn image for more than 2 seconds and then think before voting. Great image and definitely underrated, love the tilt and the positioning of the subject.', '2008-11-05 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
