(5046093, 734199, 66952, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I like the detail of the snow against the movement of the clouds and stars. Congratulations!</td>', 'Excellent. I like the detail of the snow against the movement of the clouds and stars. Congratulations!', '2008-11-05 10:35:29.000000', NULL, 0),
