(5046104, 733374, 33736, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t able to vote in this Challenge, but did take a gander at a couple of screens.  When this little guy popped up, my first thought was - "Boy, this is going to be one of the top vote-getters!"  All of us should be so talented as to get such an "unoriginal shot" as this one!  Good Luck on your show next year.</td>', 'Wasn''t able to vote in this Challenge, but did take a gander at a couple of screens.  When this little guy popped up, my first thought was - "Boy, this is going to be one of the top vote-getters!"  All of us should be so talented as to get such an "unoriginal shot" as this one!  Good Luck on your show next year.', '2008-11-05 10:38:05.000000', NULL, 0),
