(5046202, 734199, 80096, '<td valign="top">So glad this won first place! This was a fav of mine, you definitely captured the essence of the evening. Extremely well done and very well deserved ribbon, keep up the good work!!</td>', 'So glad this won first place! This was a fav of mine, you definitely captured the essence of the evening. Extremely well done and very well deserved ribbon, keep up the good work!!', '2008-11-05 11:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
