(5046359, 733296, 67697, '<td valign="top">hehe - comments are always fun to read.  My impression of the person on the left is that they are about to go into a spin and not wipe out.   I love how the light caught that one blade.  And the streaks of light from above are also cool.  I cannot believe you did not change this into black and white!  Congrats again for putting in what you like!</td>', 'hehe - comments are always fun to read.  My impression of the person on the left is that they are about to go into a spin and not wipe out.   I love how the light caught that one blade.  And the streaks of light from above are also cool.  I cannot believe you did not change this into black and white!  Congrats again for putting in what you like!', '2008-11-05 12:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046416, 734646, 60174, '<td valign="top">funny how everyone assumes these are men playing...<br/> <br/>and looks like I was right about this being too weird for DPC.  Oh well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-05 12:41:34.</i></td>', 'funny how everyone assumes these are men playing... and looks like I was right about this being too weird for DPC.  Oh well.', '2008-11-05 12:41:16.000000', '2008-11-05 12:41:34.000000', 0),
(5046423, 734407, 60174, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  this should have done much better.</td>', 'nice shot.  this should have done much better.', '2008-11-05 12:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046428, 734565, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like shots like these, where the ghost of the vehicle is all that''s left.  A nice quiet shot with rich tones.</td>', 'I like shots like these, where the ghost of the vehicle is all that''s left.  A nice quiet shot with rich tones.', '2008-11-05 12:44:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046431, 734592, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote this challenge, but when I first saw this, I thought perhaps it was skewsme''s as it reminds me a bit of her shot from France.  Who knew that Tranquility had a French feel to it when viewed through a wet windshield?  I do hope she was rewarded with very good chocolate for all that cavorting and such.  This is really quite nice, by the way.</td>', 'I didn''t vote this challenge, but when I first saw this, I thought perhaps it was skewsme''s as it reminds me a bit of her shot from France.  Who knew that Tranquility had a French feel to it when viewed through a wet windshield?  I do hope she was rewarded with very good chocolate for all that cavorting and such.  This is really quite nice, by the way.', '2008-11-05 12:46:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046435, 733390, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not a pigeon, but close enough!  I like the inclusion of the edge of the ground here - supports that sensation of "take-off" that I get from the gull''s position and wing movement.</td>', 'Not a pigeon, but close enough!  I like the inclusion of the edge of the ground here - supports that sensation of "take-off" that I get from the gull''s position and wing movement.', '2008-11-05 12:48:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046439, 733973, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well, heck - I really quite liked it, particularly how the motion and angle combined to almost erase one wing.  I like your title, too - does indeed look a bit like a runway.</td>', 'Well, heck - I really quite liked it, particularly how the motion and angle combined to almost erase one wing.  I like your title, too - does indeed look a bit like a runway.', '2008-11-05 12:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046442, 734388, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Kelli, you have the wonderful quality of entering shots that make me smile.  The look on that one guy''s face!  I imagine this was a lot of fun to watch in progress.</td>', 'LOL!  Kelli, you have the wonderful quality of entering shots that make me smile.  The look on that one guy''s face!  I imagine this was a lot of fun to watch in progress.', '2008-11-05 12:51:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046444, 732905, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  And an excellent title.  You have a way of making your camera find the quieter melodies then converting them to canvas.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  And an excellent title.  You have a way of making your camera find the quieter melodies then converting them to canvas.', '2008-11-05 12:52:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046446, 734198, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nod in the Posthumous thread beats score every time.  I still think this is pretty darn cool.</td>', 'A nod in the Posthumous thread beats score every time.  I still think this is pretty darn cool.', '2008-11-05 12:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046477, 733677, 30982, '<td valign="top">I suspect you were going for a blurred background but it wasn''t quite enough to register with the voters.  I do think this is a very good picture of the dog, though - excellent definition of the dog and he/she shows up so nicely against the dark background.  He looks to be having a very good time as well!</td>', 'I suspect you were going for a blurred background but it wasn''t quite enough to register with the voters.  I do think this is a very good picture of the dog, though - excellent definition of the dog and he/she shows up so nicely against the dark background.  He looks to be having a very good time as well!', '2008-11-05 13:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046492, 734603, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this is pretty cool.  I like how the tree isn''t on land (or at least we can''t see it here) but just exists in the water.  And I really like how the duck is almost as vivid in reflection as it is for real.  To me, the blues are probably oversaturated, but in this case, I think that works.</td>', 'I think this is pretty cool.  I like how the tree isn''t on land (or at least we can''t see it here) but just exists in the water.  And I really like how the duck is almost as vivid in reflection as it is for real.  To me, the blues are probably oversaturated, but in this case, I think that works.', '2008-11-05 13:06:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046502, 733049, 52115, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, very well done. Maybe you can give me some tips at a gtg, neighbor with a Nikon.</td>', 'Congratulations, very well done. Maybe you can give me some tips at a gtg, neighbor with a Nikon.', '2008-11-05 13:09:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046512, 734400, 30982, '<td valign="top">Incredibly sharp!  I don''t think I''ve ever tried anything like this before.  I really appreciate your explanation and thought process - very valuable learning tool!  I especially like how you figured the differences in exposure at each end of the scale - I would never have thought of that.  I''m sorry so few took the time to really look at this.  Hopefully more will now.</td>', 'Incredibly sharp!  I don''t think I''ve ever tried anything like this before.  I really appreciate your explanation and thought process - very valuable learning tool!  I especially like how you figured the differences in exposure at each end of the scale - I would never have thought of that.  I''m sorry so few took the time to really look at this.  Hopefully more will now.', '2008-11-05 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046534, 733296, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the single skate.  Everything else revolves around it.</td>', 'I love the single skate.  Everything else revolves around it.', '2008-11-05 13:16:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046567, 733616, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Way more talented than I.  Were I to try to shoot while riding, I''d hurt things.  Me, the bike, the camera....  And a very cool shot, too.</td>', 'Heh!  Way more talented than I.  Were I to try to shoot while riding, I''d hurt things.  Me, the bike, the camera....  And a very cool shot, too.', '2008-11-05 13:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046595, 733049, 33672, '<td valign="top">Ledyard CT? I was just there on Sunday. What a great shot. that has nice leading lines and is visually pleasing! Congrats!</td>', 'Ledyard CT? I was just there on Sunday. What a great shot. that has nice leading lines and is visually pleasing! Congrats!', '2008-11-05 13:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046632, 734400, 50695, '<td valign="top">lovely shot. as deb said, a real contribution to the site.</td>', 'lovely shot. as deb said, a real contribution to the site.', '2008-11-05 13:52:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046634, 734198, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is phenomenal! Love it.</td>', 'Wow, this is phenomenal! Love it.', '2008-11-05 13:53:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046636, 734675, 50695, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic shot. I wish I had voted this challenge.</td>', 'What a fantastic shot. I wish I had voted this challenge.', '2008-11-05 13:54:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046637, 733320, 50695, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, gorgeous, gorgeous. Very much like a painting.</td>', 'Gorgeous, gorgeous, gorgeous. Very much like a painting.', '2008-11-05 13:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046640, 734413, 50695, '<td valign="top">Bravo!</td>', 'Bravo!', '2008-11-05 13:56:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046642, 733049, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey peter ... BRILLIANT .. and congratulations on your ribbon and second place on your profile page .. <br/>i''m wondering why you''re driving on the rhs when you live in england .. that could be why you got the weird looks and possibly the finger .. lol .. :)<br/>i get such a feeling of motion when looking at this .. it is AWESOME . !!..:)</td>', 'hey peter ... BRILLIANT .. and congratulations on your ribbon and second place on your profile page .. i''m wondering why you''re driving on the rhs when you live in england .. that could be why you got the weird looks and possibly the finger .. lol .. :)i get such a feeling of motion when looking at this .. it is AWESOME . !!..:)', '2008-11-05 13:58:43.000000', NULL, 0),
