(5046847, 734295, 94708, '<td valign="top">idk why it says used the Kodak Easyshare...i didn''t..i thought i put it to D40</td>', 'idk why it says used the Kodak Easyshare...i didn''t..i thought i put it to D40', '2008-11-05 15:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046850, 734295, 94708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by purifier:</b></div><hr/><i> we can see clearly that the camera wasn''t stable on purpose, so it doesn''t count as motion blur...the object in your photo is suosed to be in motion  not the camera </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was out of focus, and it wasn''t on purpose.</td>', 'Originally posted by purifier: we can see clearly that the camera wasn''t stable on purpose, so it doesn''t count as motion blur...the object in your photo is suosed to be in motion  not the camera   It was out of focus, and it wasn''t on purpose.', '2008-11-05 15:13:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046868, 734400, 56275, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the surreal feeling of it. As <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> mentioned, thanks for tutorial.</td>', 'Great shot. I love the surreal feeling of it. As  Melethia mentioned, thanks for tutorial.', '2008-11-05 15:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5046946, 734199, 86020, '<td valign="top">Vel að þessu kominn, gamli! Til hamingju með borðann!</td>', 'Vel að þessu kominn, gamli! Til hamingju með borðann!', '2008-11-05 15:41:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5047197, 734729, 61651, '<td valign="top">Curses, foiled again in your attempt to hit the ever elusive 5.5.  I had a suspicion this was you.  You got the composition set nicely; I feel your pain with the multiple attempts at the shot, and I haven''t yet been brave or foolhardy yet to try involving other living creatures.  :)</td>', 'Curses, foiled again in your attempt to hit the ever elusive 5.5.  I had a suspicion this was you.  You got the composition set nicely; I feel your pain with the multiple attempts at the shot, and I haven''t yet been brave or foolhardy yet to try involving other living creatures.  :)', '2008-11-05 17:27:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5047215, 733966, 45475, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the dominance of the brown bg may have contributed to a lower vote by some. Might be worthwhile for you to play around with hue&amp;sat to see what happens. Or maybe duotone with blues?<br/> <br/>Still, this absolutely sings!</td>', 'I wonder if the dominance of the brown bg may have contributed to a lower vote by some. Might be worthwhile for you to play around with hue&sat to see what happens. Or maybe duotone with blues? Still, this absolutely sings!', '2008-11-05 17:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
