(5048976, 732905, 61651, '<td valign="top">Vaseline on a filter? Delightful lighting, and I particularly like how yours and Don''s shot have complementary titles.  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=734592" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/940/120/734592.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/940/120/734592.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/940/120/734592.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Vaseline on a filter? Delightful lighting, and I particularly like how yours and Don''s shot have complementary titles.  ', '2008-11-06 14:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
