(5051688, 733677, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a dog in all his goofy exuberance, this is a heartwarming image to view.  I assume you were trying to pan - looks like the dog''s speed vs. shutter speed wasn''t paired well enough to get background blur.  A slower shutter might have gotten more blur.</td>', 'Nice capture of a dog in all his goofy exuberance, this is a heartwarming image to view.  I assume you were trying to pan - looks like the dog''s speed vs. shutter speed wasn''t paired well enough to get background blur.  A slower shutter might have gotten more blur.', '2008-11-07 23:05:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5051694, 733296, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like shots like this that get more to what life feels like, beyond what we can just see with our eyes.  Awesome luck with that one bright sharp skate amidst all that delicate fuzziness.</td>', 'I like shots like this that get more to what life feels like, beyond what we can just see with our eyes.  Awesome luck with that one bright sharp skate amidst all that delicate fuzziness.', '2008-11-07 23:08:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5051992, 734675, 68504, '<td valign="top">My God, the whole thing is a reflection. What a fascinating effect, and not affecting the figures in the background.  Which also are not so affected by the long exposure. Everything happening on the right, and just a big whoosh to the left, just as the subject steps onto the magic manhole.  Wish I had voted and had the wit to add to your tens.</td>', 'My God, the whole thing is a reflection. What a fascinating effect, and not affecting the figures in the background.  Which also are not so affected by the long exposure. Everything happening on the right, and just a big whoosh to the left, just as the subject steps onto the magic manhole.  Wish I had voted and had the wit to add to your tens.', '2008-11-08 02:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
